        // ── complexity (measurement honesty #7): the correctness ORACLE
        // for a gated fast path is the SAME graph through the SAME entry
        // point, flipped only by the admission switch ─────────────────
        // Source: tests/test-tiled-mulmat.cpp (cpu_set_use_ref toggle +
